WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.054 --> 00:00:08.079
"Baby Martha is here today," Mom said.

2
00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:12.451
"Please help me babysit."

3
00:00:12.452 --> 00:00:17.590
"Rover always wants to help with Martha," Harry said.

4
00:00:17.591 --> 00:00:20.243
"But he's not very helpful."

5
00:00:20.244 --> 00:00:22.332
Mom nodded.

6
00:00:22.333 --> 00:00:27.771
"Try to find something they both like."

7
00:00:27.772 --> 00:00:33.197
"Let's take them for a ride," Emmy said.

8
00:00:33.198 --> 00:00:37.743
Emmy put Martha in her stroller.

9
00:00:37.744 --> 00:00:41.594
Martha smiled and laughed.

10
00:00:41.595 --> 00:00:44.250
Harry put Rover in the wagon.

11
00:00:44.251 --> 00:00:47.396
But the dog jumped right out.

12
00:00:47.397 --> 00:00:53.143
"Rover doesn't like riding," Harry said.

13
00:00:53.144 --> 00:00:58.163
"He likes playing with a ball!" Oliver said.

14
00:00:58.164 --> 00:01:04.680
He threw a ball, and Rover brought it back.

15
00:01:04.681 --> 00:01:11.405
"Maybe Martha likes playing with a ball."

16
00:01:11.406 --> 00:01:14.651
Emmy sat on the ground with Martha.

17
00:01:14.652 --> 00:01:18.133
Harry rolled a ball to Martha.

18
00:01:18.134 --> 00:01:22.937
But she wasn't interested.

19
00:01:22.938 --> 00:01:29.128
"Martha doesn't like playing with a ball," Harry said.

20
00:01:29.129 --> 00:01:33.383
"Let's play peekaboo," Emmy said.

21
00:01:33.384 --> 00:01:37.411
Oliver put Martha's blanket over his head.

22
00:01:37.412 --> 00:01:43.272
He quickly pulled it off. "Peekaboo!"

23
00:01:43.273 --> 00:01:48.205
Rover barked loudly. "Woof! Woof!"

24
00:01:48.206 --> 00:01:51.795
Martha looked scared.

25
00:01:51.796 --> 00:01:56.730
She burst into tears.

26
00:01:56.731 --> 00:02:01.749
"They both hate peekaboo!" Oliver said.

27
00:02:01.750 --> 00:02:05.082
"Ugh!" Harry said.

28
00:02:05.083 --> 00:02:09.207
"There's nothing they both like!"

29
00:02:09.208 --> 00:02:14.122
"I have another idea," Emmy said.

30
00:02:14.123 --> 00:02:17.770
Everyone went inside.

31
00:02:17.771 --> 00:02:21.690
Emmy sat on the couch with Rover and Martha.

32
00:02:21.691 --> 00:02:26.391
She read them some stories.

33
00:02:26.392 --> 00:02:30.002
Soon the dog and the baby were asleep.

34
00:02:30.003 --> 00:02:38.382
Emmy grinned. "They both like stories and naps!"

